<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 3.214 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 3.214 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all five auctions whereby it sought to drain 3.214 billion pesos in the secondary market on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>	700 million  28 days   20.97 pct</p>
<p>    1.000 bln  22 days   19.99 pct</p>
<p>	600 million  15 days   20.05 pct</p>
<p>	600 million   7 days   19.72 pct</p>
<p>	314 million   1 day    19.24 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
